{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>MyClipboard </strong>is a powerful, lightweight, silent and user-friendly Windows clipboard manager that gives you full control over your copied content</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Access your clipboard history instantly and stay organized</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Quick Access with Shortcuts:</strong> Open the app anytime using a customizable keyboard shortcut to quickly retrieve previous clipboard items</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Smart Clipboard History:</strong> Automatically display copied text, images, files and more in a clean, organized interface</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Favorites System:</strong> Pin important clipboard items to access them instantly anytime</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Search Functionality:</strong> Easily search through your clipboard history to find exactly what you need</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Blacklist System:</strong> Exclude specific apps or content types from being saved</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Source Provider Tracking:</strong> Instantly see where each clipboard item originated</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Built-in Image Editor:</strong> Edit copied images directly within the app</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Clipboard Backup:</strong> Securely save and restore your clipboard history</p></li></ul>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"100","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3459000/a1336f6abfbf6f750238cd6f1f29519194ea5d35.jpg"},{"name":"500","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3459000/a3fde079dee01d666b04ca5127609104d934d527.jpg"},{"name":"1000","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3459000/b865e59d6226e5d1bd99169316f0221e0397c8d9.jpg"},{"name":"Recovered x50","path":"https://cdn.